; ============================================================================
; fib C SAFE -- VOL-REGIME (structural-break) filter combination sweep
; EA: Marius Hedger M5 v1.0 fib C SAFE  |  GOLD M5  |  EVERY TICK  |  Dec2025-Jun2026
; Load via Strategy Tester -> Inputs tab -> Load, then tick Optimization.
; USE "Slow complete algorithm" (NOT genetic -- genetic prunes the grid).
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Master UseVolRegimeFilter is FIXED ON, so the pass where all 3 toggles=0
; reproduces the live baseline INSIDE the results table (your reference row).
; Swept (32 passes):
;   VolBlockAllEntries {off,on}  (a) sit out the storm
;   VolBlockStacking   {off,on}  (b) allow 1st entry/dir, no piling in
;   VolScaledFloor     {off,on}  (c) widen floor 30%->60% so baskets ride out
;   VolRegimeMult      {2.5,3.0,3.5,4.0}  HOT threshold (Feb-4 was ~7-11x)
; VolFloorMaxMult FIXED 2.0 here -> sweep it as stage-2 on the winning combo.
; Report per pass: Net, Profit Factor, max equity DD %, Recovery Factor.
; NOTE: a+b == a (a blocks ALL entries, subsumes b); rows with all toggles=0
;   are baseline duplicates across the 4 mult values -- expected, ignore dupes.
; ============================================================================

; ---- SWEPT: vol-regime levers ----
UseVolRegimeFilter=1
UseVolRegimeFilter,F=0

VolBlockAllEntries=1
VolBlockAllEntries,F=1
VolBlockAllEntries,1=0
VolBlockAllEntries,2=1
VolBlockAllEntries,3=1

VolBlockStacking=0
